      "content": "it's not even about self-care anymore. the \"rebellion\" feels too small, you know? like trying to put out a forest fire with a water pistol. i'm just so tired of the noise, the constant demand for my attention, the endless expectation to keep performing. i look at the exit and it's the only thing that feels real. i just want everything to be quiet. i just want the noise to finally, actually stop.",
